  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A horizontal spring is used to launch a toy car. When the spring is compressed by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18\"></span> cm, the toy car is launched with an initial speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. By how much should the spring be compressed in order for the toy car to be launched with an initial speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9.0\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{18}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span> cm</li>\n</ol>"
